{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/bbschool.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/bbschool.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_01_01",
      "hash64": "99E1CBDF40414064",
      "text": "欢迎来到蓝莓学园！\\c\\n如果你是第一次乘地铁和海中电梯\\n上学的话，一定很吃惊吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_01_02",
      "hash64": "99E1CEDF4041457D",
      "text": "恭喜你，新冠军！\\n居然能战胜乌栗，你真厉害。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_01_03",
      "hash64": "99E1CDDF404143CA",
      "text": "自从你来了之后，\\n学园就变得热闹起来了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_05_01",
      "hash64": "3F0543C0D1868BE8",
      "text": "下一节课\\n该到哪个区域上来着？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_06_01",
      "hash64": "69EFBBB58879C6FF",
      "text": "去极地区时，\\n不穿厚一点的话，会感冒哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_11_01",
      "hash64": "568963BD3A157AAB",
      "text": "你就是留学生？\\n看上去不怎么强嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_12_01",
      "hash64": "84436BC39CF12174",
      "text": "如果宝可梦不够强的话，\\n在我们学园可是混不下去的哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_11_02",
      "hash64": "568964BD3A157C5E",
      "text": "真是人不可貌相，\\n你的宝可梦很强嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_12_02",
      "hash64": "84436EC39CF1268D",
      "text": "那个甚至打赢了杜若的乌栗，\\n居然输了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_11_03",
      "hash64": "568965BD3A157E11",
      "text": "我也想像你一样\\n变得更强。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_12_03",
      "hash64": "84436DC39CF124DA",
      "text": "在帕底亚有很多\\n像你一样强大的人对吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_14_01",
      "hash64": "26976F93824E30DA",
      "text": "精灵球无论有多少个都不够啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_15_01",
      "hash64": "529E5B99E3B8138F",
      "text": "通过蓝乐活收集ＢＰ，\\n买些好的球吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_22_01",
      "hash64": "570143302C7F5191",
      "text": "入口的对战场是给\\n蓝莓联盟的官方对战使用的！\\c\\n进行冠军战时，\\n观众席会被观众塞得满满的哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_23_01",
      "hash64": "7FCC3724E1A4F8FC",
      "text": "我看了你和紫竽的对战！\\n有我没见过的宝可梦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_22_02",
      "hash64": "570140302C7F4C78",
      "text": "冠军战太精彩了！\\n乌栗会降为四天王吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_23_02",
      "hash64": "7FCC3A24E1A4FE15",
      "text": "我看了你和乌栗的对战！\\n乌栗……看上去很难过啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_22_03",
      "hash64": "570141302C7F4E2B",
      "text": "我也要以成为冠军为目标，\\n加倍努力。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_23_03",
      "hash64": "7FCC3924E1A4FC62",
      "text": "看了你的对战后，\\n我成为你的粉丝了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_26_01",
      "hash64": "26977B0B9A53D955",
      "text": "在蓝莓学园，\\n双打对战是主流。\\c\\n……理由应该是能运用到\\n更丰富的战略之类的吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_48_01",
      "hash64": "0CCDD383BC364E3D",
      "text": "让我们在草原区\\n捕捉独角犀牛吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "bbschool_entrance_npc_49_01",
      "hash64": "374C477872CE63A8",
      "text": "岩石属性研究Ⅱ好难，\\n我搞不懂……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_eve_npc_01",
      "hash64": "1C17ACEE4FF1A83B",
      "text": "正电拍拍的特性是正电！\\c\\n有负电拍拍和它在一起的话，\\n它的特攻就会变强哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_eve_npc_10",
      "hash64": "1C1B31EE4FF4C011",
      "text": "我不懂属性相克，\\n会在对战中看笔记。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_eve_npc_11",
      "hash64": "1C1B30EE4FF4BE5E",
      "text": "因为在寒冷时花草会枯萎，\\n所以冰属性克草属性！\\c\\n只要像这样去想象，\\n就能简单记住属性相克了哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_ni_npc_03",
      "hash64": "05D3C80A27AFEA1A",
      "text": "这个教室位于海中！\\c\\n因此使用屏幕显示天空\\n来减少闭塞感。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "bbschool_class_a_ni_npc_04",
      "hash64": "05D3C30A27AFE19B",
      "text": "如果现实世界是夜晚，\\n巨蛋里面也会显示出夜空，\\r\\n是与时间联动的啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_01",
      "hash64": "43A1B111E3CDBD18",
      "text": "虽然丹瑜很任性，\\n但却让人讨厌不起来～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_02",
      "hash64": "43A1B411E3CDC231",
      "text": "我们班有\\n学生会长纳莉和\\r\\n捣蛋女孩丹瑜在哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_08",
      "hash64": "43A1AA11E3CDB133",
      "text": "在同一个地方绕圈圈，\\n就能很厉害地打起转来哦，你知道吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_eve_npc_09",
      "hash64": "43A1A911E3CDAF80",
      "text": "在巨蛋中有一个\\n有风吹过的草原，\\r\\n感觉在那里打转会很有趣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "bbschool_class_b_ni_npc_02",
      "hash64": "4CBCFFE41455FEC0",
      "text": "我漫步在草原时，\\n有风不知从何处吹来，\\r\\n然后听到了神秘的歌声。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_01",
      "hash64": "88BF4FEFD500A857",
      "text": "我将来想在\\n友好商店工作，\\r\\n所以正在调查人气道具呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_06",
      "hash64": "88BF4CEFD500A33E",
      "text": "就算没有宝可梦的掉落物，\\n只要有ＢＰ，\\r\\n就能买招式学习器，十分便利！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_07",
      "hash64": "88BF4DEFD500A4F1",
      "text": "宝可梦的招式“帮助”！\\n在双打对战中能大放异彩哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_eve_npc_09",
      "hash64": "88BF47EFD5009ABF",
      "text": "球和伤药能够在\\n巨蛋内的自动售货机买到哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "bbschool_shop_ni_npc_01",
      "hash64": "583FBDEA529D9068",
      "text": "复合金属能够用在\\n什么宝可梦上面呢？\\r\\n像金属一样的宝可梦吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_03",
      "hash64": "37B4AB4CD1A6BE52",
      "text": "食堂的菜虽然味道很浓，\\n但食力对全属性都有效，\\r\\n如果你有ＢＰ就去吃吃看吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_04",
      "hash64": "37B4A64CD1A6B5D3",
      "text": "要野餐的话，\\n果然还是该选峡谷区！\\r\\n而且那还是纳莉的地盘！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_05",
      "hash64": "37B4A54CD1A6B420",
      "text": "想吃三明治的话，\\n那就要到海岸区了！\\r\\n而且那里还有紫竽的广场！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_14",
      "hash64": "37B1284CD1A3A9E2",
      "text": "想要跟四天王对战，\\n必须先通过四天王挑战哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_eve_npc_15",
      "hash64": "37B1294CD1A3AB95",
      "text": "因为我恐高，\\n所以纳莉的挑战我可受不了～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_03",
      "hash64": "BE6E89CD48A7E7FF",
      "text": "四天王当中，我喜欢杜若！\\n他看上去没什么干劲，实际上却很厉害哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_04",
      "hash64": "BE6E86CD48A7E2E6",
      "text": "四天王的赤松\\n有点粗心大意，很可爱～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_09",
      "hash64": "BE6E93CD48A7F8FD",
      "text": "好冷好冷……\\n在极地区身体都要冻僵了。\\r\\n吃比萨暖暖身子吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "bbschool_dining_ni_npc_13",
      "hash64": "BE7211CD48AB04EE",
      "text": "食堂的菜单全都是\\n席蓝校长爱吃的哦！\\c\\n虽然看上去营养很不均衡，\\n但食力很厉害哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_default_02",
      "hash64": "4838AF90CBE7C23A",
      "text": "我的无畏小子\\n很喜欢跑步机！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_default_03",
      "hash64": "4838B090CBE7C3ED",
      "text": "我呀，要跟皮卡丘一起\\n在蓝莓联盟加油！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_gorgeous_03",
      "hash64": "0B52C2D553842AA5",
      "text": "房间金光闪闪！\\n喵喵可高兴了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_gorgeous_04",
      "hash64": "0B52BBD553841EC0",
      "text": "喵喵竖起了爪子，\\n一副蠢蠢欲动的样子！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_fancy_02",
      "hash64": "379821920A2E597E",
      "text": "幻彩的社团活动室！\\n紫竽应该会喜欢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_future_02",
      "hash64": "9EF15DD9F764F7C8",
      "text": "这个房间跟金属怪……\\n感觉很搭配！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_future_04",
      "hash64": "9EF163D9F76501FA",
      "text": "这个社团活动室好帅！\\n美术社真厉害呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_future_06",
      "hash64": "9EF161D9F764FE94",
      "text": "啊，那个难道是\\n电影中的神秘的圆盘！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_retro_02",
      "hash64": "A7536668B59027E1",
      "text": "这个房间里有好多\\n看上去喜欢挖掘的宝可梦啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_monotone_01",
      "hash64": "31B3FBDF672CBF89",
      "text": "斑斑马在黑白的房间里\\n很难被看出来，真可爱～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_monotone_04",
      "hash64": "31B3FEDF672CC4A2",
      "text": "你知道吗？盔甲鸟的弱点很少，\\n所以很难对付哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_natural_02",
      "hash64": "E9D685C1A393F632",
      "text": "社团活动室里充满了大自然！\\n草宝可梦看上去也很高兴！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "bbschool_clubroom_dark_05",
      "hash64": "2503A7FD20029400",
      "text": "谢谢你把社团活动室的\\n主题染成暗黑。\\r\\n要的就是阴暗的感觉……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
